  "help": "Inventory\nDrag items to move or stack.\nRight-click gear equips; potions heal.\nBag to gear equips; reverse removes.\nPrev / Next changes bag page.\n\nShop\nSelect offer and Buy; bag item to\nSell / Repair. Arrows page stock.\n\nWarehouse\nUnlock first. Select source, then\ndestination. Coin icons transfer gold.\n\nFriends / Party\nSelect a name for social actions.\nAccept / Decline responds to invites.\n\nEnter chat | Esc cancel | I bag | U char\nZ/X/B target | R attack | T walk/run\nE auto-run | click a chest to loot",
